        "body": "Asrc Federal Facilities Logistics obligations fell 31.8% year over year. Asrc Federal Facilities Logistics obligated $514M in FY26, down from FY25 $753M and FY24 $704M. Yearly history shows a peak at FY25 $753M after growth from FY21 $549M through FY23 $714M. The pattern shows a recent pullback from the FY25 high."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What markets and products drive Asrc Federal Facilities Logistics obligations?",
